WEBVTT

00:04:29.329 --> 00:04:34.663
But in time when you start casting your
net a whole lot wider feeling dejected.

00:04:34.704 --> 00:04:36.746
Aaron finally started looking
out of state,

00:04:37.163 --> 00:04:39.704
which would have meant leaving
his entire family behind.

00:04:39.954 --> 00:04:42.913
My brother, my sister, my mom and dad,
they're all right there.

00:04:43.371 --> 00:04:46.704
When you talk about moving to California
from Florida, that's you know,

00:04:46.704 --> 00:04:51.788
that's a desperate move. But something's,
you know, something's got to give here.

00:04:52.246 --> 00:04:55.163
I couldn't find another
job to save my life.

00:04:55.621 --> 00:04:58.413
Aaron spent two and a half years
looking for full time work.

00:04:58.913 --> 00:05:02.329
He had a newborn son, so his financial
responsibilities were growing.